DESCRIPTION:As teams grow\, so do the demands on hiring\, onboarding\, tra
 ining\, and performance management. This session explored how AI can suppo
 rt smarter\, more efficient people operations- without replacing the human
  element that makes teams successful. Hosted by StoredTech\, this workshop
  focuses on real-world applications of AI i HR and team management. Partic
 ipants will explore how AI tools can streamline recruiting\, improve train
 ing and documentation\, support workload planning\, and create more consis
 tent team workflows. In this session\, you'll learn: How AI can assist wit
 h recruiting\, role definition\, and candidate evaluation Ways to use AI t
 o document processes\, standardize training\, and support onboarding How A
 I can help with task prioritization\, scheduling\, and workload management
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
