UID:5297f19d1316eba20027290fc7298fc6@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a three-part guided book club series exploring The
  Let Them Theory by Mel Robbins sponsored by North State Bank. This isn't 
 your typical book club—it's an interactive\, conversation-driven experie
 nce designed to help participants apply the book's powerful lessons to the
 ir own lives\, relationships\, and personal growth. Over three sessions\, 
 we'll dive into key concepts from the book through facilitated discussions
 \, thoughtful reflection\, and shared experiences with fellow attendees. W
 hether you're looking to reduce stress\, let go of what you can't control\
 , or build healthier relationships\, this series will provide practical in
 sights and meaningful conversation in a supportive environment. Registrati
 on is $30 and includes: Three guided book club sessions Facilitated group 
 discussions Lunch at each session Opportunities to connect and learn with 
 other participants Dates: Sept. 9th\, October 14th and November 19th. Plea
 se note: Participants are responsible for purchasing their own
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/wba-book-cl
 ub-the-let-them-theory-by-mel-robbins
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
