DESCRIPTION:Join the Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce and Wake Forest Cotto
 n Company for a fun-filled Summer Night Market in downtown Wake Forest! Sp
 end a summer evening shopping local and supporting small businesses while 
 enjoying a vibrant community atmosphere. Browse more than 40 local vendors
 \, including 20+ outdoor market vendors and 20+ vendors inside Wake Forest
  Cotton Company\, offering unique gifts\, handcrafted goods\, boutique ite
 ms\, home décor\, specialty foods\, and more. Grab dinner from a deliciou
 s local food truck\, discover new downtown businesses\, and enjoy a relaxe
 d evening of shopping\, networking\, and community connection. Whether you
 're searching for the perfect gift\, treating yourself\, or simply looking
  for a great way to spend a summer night\, the Summer Night Market is the 
 perfect place to shop\, eat\, and connect with friends and neighbors. We l
 ook forward to seeing you there!
